    "title": "League Secretary",
    "description": "For Bowling Leagues that utilize the League Secretary service, this app enables you to view your current season bowling league Standings, Recaps, Schedule, along with Bowler and Team histories for the season.\r\n\r\nThe app will also send you notifications on when your league admin has updated your data as well as a notification on the day you bowl telling you what lane you are bowling on.\r\n\r\nAccess for an unlimited number of leagues to:\r\n\u2022\tStandings and Recap Sheets\r\n\u2022\tIndividual Bowler and Team Info\r\n\u2022\tBowler and Team Lists\r\n\u2022\tSeason Schedule\r\n\u2022\tStandings Update and Lane Assignment Alerts\r\n\r\nAn optional subscription is available at 1 month ($.99) and 1 year ($9.99) durations.  The subscription will turn off all advertisements.\r\n\r\n\u2022 The subscription will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (at the duration selected) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Current subscription may not be cancelled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your Google Play Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://app.termly.io/document/terms-of-use-for-website/c5fe7fa4-7889-4870-ab8d-0e1ff9f6f93e\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://app.termly.io/document/privacy-policy/7257cdd9-3e18-45ee-be0f-b509689e7149",
